### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_HERE
@targetUserId = TARGET_USER_ID_HERE

### 1. Platform Statistics Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. List All Platform Users (Paginated & Filterable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?page=1&limit=20&role=recruiter
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3. Approve / Moderate Recruiter Account
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{targetUserId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "status": "approved"
}

### 4. Delete User Account
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{targetUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
